XTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0002>-群胚纤维化范畴所成范畴（category of categories fibred in groupoids），其基底为<MATH_0003><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是子<MATH_0004>-范畴（category），包含于<MATH_0005>-范畴（category）（由<MATH_0006>上的纤维化范畴（fibred categories）构成，见定义<REF_0001>），定义如下：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 其对象（objects）是范畴（categories）<MATH_0007>，它们在群胚（groupoids）中纤维化（fibred）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 其<MATH_0008>-态射（morphisms）<MATH_0009>为函子（functors）<MATH_0010>，满足<MATH_0011>（由于每个态射（morphism）都是强笛卡尔的（strongly cartesian），<MATH_0012>自动保持它们）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 其<MATH_0013>-态射（morphisms）<MATH_0014>（对于<MATH_0015>）是函子（functors）间的态射（morphisms），满足<MATH_0016>，对所有<MATH_0017>均如此。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:429d9f519c011332708b3c51089a3ddac685fee815954726ae91ccc3065e13f0", "unit_id": "tag:02XS:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "基底以及带受保护数值限定的高阶范畴；待决。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "本定义完整命名的高阶范畴，数值限定与基底保持受保护；待决。", "source_term": "category of categories fibred in groupoids", "target_term": "群胚纤维化范畴所成范畴"}, {"context": "所取子范畴所在的纤维化范畴环境；待决。", "source_term": "fibred categories", "target_term": "纤维化范畴"}, {"context": "新高阶范畴的对象；待决。", "source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "这些对象本身是范畴；待决。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "对象范畴的纤维化条件；待决。", "source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"context": "对象范畴的群胚条件；待决。", "source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "各层态射及函子间的态射；待决。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "第一层态射及第二层态射的两端；待决。", "source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "对象范畴中的任意态射；待决。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "保证自动保持的态射性质；待决。", "source_term": "strongly cartesian", "target_term": "强笛卡尔的"}]}
